brian-chuck programs vendored for integration testing
======================================================

`.in` files from the upstream brian-chuck repo:

  https://github.com/m-ender/brian-chuck

each `.in` is `<name>.bc` from `examples/`, renamed for the goruby
test harness glob. `.expected` generated by running

  ruby internal/integrationtest/testdata/gems/brian-chuck/brian-chuck.rb \
       <fixture>.in </dev/null > <fixture>.expected

under MRI 2.6.10.

omitted programs and why
------------------------

- truth-machine.bc -- crashes under MRI itself (non-zero exit). no
  useful baseline to compare against until upstream fixes (or we
  decide to accept the error state explicitly).

